                                "example_id": "a239a482-7957-47a4-bd54-af3e678e2017",
                                "sense_id": "b6c65626-46bf-3fa0-a813-0dfe60a1e31c",
                                "text": "\"What made you harp upon the war, man, knowing what his opinions are?\" the doctor asked vexedly, as he stumbled along the uneven stone passage towards the hall."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "92d2699f-25eb-43b2-832c-cc3055091d72",
                                "sense_id": "b6c65626-46bf-3fa0-a813-0dfe60a1e31c",
                                "text": "If only Dr. Spiller had sent me a wire yesterday,\" he exclaimed vexedly, \"he had my address in the country, I should have been saved a useless visit to London!\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
